   "heading": "ON q -ANALOGUES OF THE FOURIER AND HANKEL TRANSFORMS TOM H. KOORNWINDER and REN ´ E F. SWARTTOUW 1. Introduction Several possible q -analogues of the Bessel function have been considered in the literature. Best known are two related q -Bessel functions denoted J (1) α ( x ; q ) and J (2) α ( x ; q )",
